    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "The URL should come from the widgetParams not the InstantSearch instance to allow other users to override it. Right now we don't have a way to override it from user code. For example in Vue we should be able to do something like:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nexport default {\r\n  mixins: [createWidget({ connector: connectPoweredBy })],\r\n  computed: {\r\n    widgetParams() {\r\n      return {\r\n        // it would be nice to also support this:\r\n        source: \"vue-instantsearch\",\r\n        // but also\r\n        URL:\r\n          \"https://www.algolia.com/?\" +\r\n          \"utm_source=vue-instantsearch&\" +\r\n          \"utm_medium=website&\" +\r\n          `utm_content=${location ? location.hostname : \"\"}&` +\r\n          \"utm_campaign=poweredby\"\r\n      };\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n};\r\n```",
